      statusNote: 'The proposal went to the Administrative Commission on 14 May 2026. Cosse played down the initiative, describing it to Brecha as an "idea" still "very far, even, from being a preliminary design" and open to changes, and answered the criticism by saying it is "a serious proposal, with technical grounding" that should be discussed without shouting or social-media pile-ons. On 9 May 2026 Economy Minister Gabriel Oddone said of the works, to la diaria: "At this moment I would not do it". As of this file\'s closing (August 2026) there is no record of a tender being called.',
